WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.929
QuotePlate connects your kitchen, purchasing decisions
and suppliers.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.779
Start with your restaurant’s name, phone and address.

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:11.084
Add your city, state and PIN code for deliveries.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.324
Enter the owner’s name and work email.

00:00:19.544 --> 00:00:24.408
For approved pilot owners, continue with Google to
create the workspace and open Today.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.636
Type or paste dishes, upload photos, or take a menu
photo on your phone.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.715
Or use a permitted website link.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.309
Here, we type tomato curry, then review the
ingredients, quantity and unit.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.325
Approve your menu before making a purchase.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.118
Open Suppliers and add the businesses you buy from.

00:01:00.338 --> 00:01:02.759
Enter their names and ingredient categories.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:06.051
We add two example suppliers to compare their replies.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.891
Choose New purchase. Give it a name and select the
approved menu.

00:01:15.111 --> 00:01:17.948
Check quantities. We need ten kilos of tomatoes.

00:01:18.168 --> 00:01:20.526
Set the delivery date and reply deadline.

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:24.010
Choose your suppliers, save the draft, then open it
for quotes.

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:38.299
Suppliers can quote on their phone. Choose a clear
price-list photo, or paste prices.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.662
Check the matched item and rate, then fill the quote.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.516
Use one item at a time if helpful. Review delivery and
the total, then send.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.781
Back in Purchases, compare the complete offers.

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:58.229
Check coverage, tax, delivery charges and dates.

00:01:58.449 --> 00:02:01.863
Here, the totals are four hundred and four hundred
forty rupees.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.901
Choose the suitable supplier and confirm your
decision.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.890
Now check what actually arrives.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.810
We ordered ten kilos, but received nine.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.099
Enter received quantities and check the invoice.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:28.402
Record the missing kilo and forty rupees in credit
still owed, then save.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.442
Return to Today to see purchases and delivery follow-
ups.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.619
Keep every purchase clear.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.712
Start your first purchase with QuotePlate. Every
quote, accountable.
